---
import { ArrowRight, ChevronDown } from "lucide-astro";
import "../../styles/hero.css";
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-svh items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/background.png"
      alt="森の中に置かれたグランドピアノ"
      class="animate-hero-zoom h-full w-full object-cover"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1d1812]/60 via-[#1d1812]/25 to-[#1d1812]/60"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,transparent_30%,rgb(20_16_10/0.4)_100%)]"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-20 pt-24 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p
      class="animate-fade-in-up font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.35em] text-white/85 sm:text-sm"
    >
      岐阜県中津川市にある小さなピアノ教室
    </p>
    <h1
      class="animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-200 mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_28px_rgb(0_0_0/0.45)] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
    >
      音楽で心を豊かに
    </h1>
    <p
      class="animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-400 mt-7 text-sm leading-7 text-white/90 sm:text-base sm:leading-8 md:text-lg"
    >
      本教室では楽しくピアノを弾くことを目指しています<br />
      初心者の方から経験者まで、どなたでもお気軽にお越しください
    </p>
    <div
      class="animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-600 mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4"
    >
      <a
        href="/contact?type=trial"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground shadow-lg shadow-black/25 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-primary/90 hover:shadow-xl sm:text-base"
      >
        無料体験レッスンを申し込む
        <ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="/pricing"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/45 bg-white/10 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 sm:text-base"
      >
        料金プランを見る
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#features"
    aria-label="下へスクロール"
    class="animate-drift absolute bottom-7 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2"
  >
    <span
      class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:bg-white/20"
    >
      <ChevronDown class="h-5 w-5 text-white/90" />
    </span>
  </a>
</section>
